					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-159209#post-1990697</guid>
				<title>Noise, SCP-543</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-159209/scp-543#post-1990697</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 13 Mar 2014 19:07:30 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1359534</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><sub>Srsly guys</sub> Take the time to read this if you haven't. It's a great article.</p> <p>Also, I'm suggesting format edits to the interview logs (line spacing, quote tags). I suggest that &quot;he&quot; be replaced with something like &quot;Subject&quot;. I like the Rorschach style documentation and think it adds to the creepypasta feel.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
