					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-159209#post-1691789</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-159209/scp-543#post-1691789</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 22 Jan 2013 02:25:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Hawkin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1529032</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I honestly like 544 more than 425. 425's manifestation was implied to be a property of the object itself, whereas this one is implied to be something detectable by anyone who knows how. The &quot;lonely guy in his apartment notices something and follows it to the point of madness&quot; bit is more interesting to me than &quot;weird TV does weird things.&quot; Not to say that 425 *isn't* interesting, as it is.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
